stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Miss
  Miss --> Leased: acquire single-flight lease
  Leased --> TempWriting: O_EXCL 0600 in target filesystem
  TempWriting --> TempSynced: exact writes + fdatasync
  TempSynced --> TempVerified: reopen + full validator
  TempVerified --> ObjectPublished: no-replace immutable digest path
  ObjectPublished --> ObjectDirSynced: fsync object directory
  ObjectDirSynced --> ManifestAuthenticated: canonical manifest + HMAC
  ManifestAuthenticated --> ManifestTempSynced: exact write + fsync
  ManifestTempSynced --> ManifestCommitted: CAS/atomic replace + fsync directory
  ManifestCommitted --> AuthenticatedCatalogEntryReachable
  TempWriting --> Abort: any error
  TempSynced --> Abort: validation error
  TempVerified --> Abort: publish error
  ManifestAuthenticated --> Abort: key/HMAC error
  ObjectPublished --> SafeOrphan: crash before manifest
  SafeOrphan --> GarbageCollected: orphan grace period
  Abort --> Miss
